@startuml
'CareerPulse V4 — classes persistées selon le schéma SQL'
title CareerPulse V4 — diagramme de classes
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #418263
  HeaderBackgroundColor #153D2D
  HeaderFontColor #FFFFFF
  FontColor #20332B
}

class Utilisateur <<users>> {
  +id: int {PK}
  +name: string
  +email: string {UNIQUE}
  +password_hash: string
  +study: string
  +skills: text
  +goal: text
  +status: string
  +created_at: datetime
  +create(...)
  +findByEmail(email)
  +updateProfile(id, profile)
  +sessionProfile()
  +all()
  +toggleStatus(id)
}

class Offre <<offers>> {
  +id: string {PK}
  +title: string
  +company: string
  +type: string
  +category: string
  +location: string
  +skills: string
  +match_score: int
  +status: string
  +created_at: datetime
  +all()
  +visibleToStudents(type)
  +findApplicable(id)
  +exists(id)
  +setStatus(id, status)
}

class Candidature <<applications>> {
  +id: int {PK}
  +user_id: int {FK}
  +offer_id: string {FK}
  +status: string
  +applied_at: date
  +create(userId, offerId)
  +forUser(userId)
  +all()
  +countPending()
  +setStatus(id, status)
}

class Formation <<courses>> {
  +id: int {PK}
  +title: string
  +category: string
  +duration: string
  +level: string
  +image: string
  +skills: string
  +all()
}

class Signalement <<reports>> {
  +id: string {PK}
  +subject: string
  +reason: string
  +status: string
  +created_at: datetime
  +all()
  +countOpen()
  +resolve(id)
}

class Notification <<notifications>> {
  +id: int {PK}
  +title: string
  +body: string
  +is_read: bool
  +created_at: datetime
  +all()
  +markAllRead()
}

Utilisateur "1" --> "0..*" Candidature : dépose
Offre "1" --> "0..*" Candidature : concerne

note bottom of Candidature
Les associations Utilisateur–Candidature et Offre–Candidature
correspondent aux clés étrangères du schéma SQL.
La contrainte UNIQUE(user_id, offer_id) empêche les doublons.
end note
note right of Utilisateur
users.status est un ENUM SQL : active ou suspended.
end note
@enduml
